{
    "background_story": "Rowen was a brilliant engineer with a passion for music. Growing up, he spent hours in his father's workshop, tinkering with gadgets and machinery. As he entered adulthood, Rowen's fascination with sound and technology led him to become an expert in musical instrumentation. He designed and built innovative instruments that combined traditional craftsmanship with cutting-edge electronics. His creations, such as the 'Sonic Sphere' and the 'Aurora Harp', were highly sought after by musicians and composers worldwide. Rowen's company, 'Resonance Instruments', became a hub for experimental music and artistic collaboration. His work not only pushed the boundaries of sound but also inspired a new generation of musicians and inventors to explore the intersection of technology and art.",
